# lib/ is committed: npm installs this fork from git, and a git dependency with a
# prepare, build, prepack, preinstall, install or postinstall script gets a
# nested, unlocked npm install on every consumer's npm ci. Rebuild with
# `npm run build:lib` (a name npm doesn't treat as a lifecycle script) and
# commit lib/ with any change to src/.
